# Studio S0→S2 API 链 — REST Client / Thunder Client
#
# 前置（JNPF 登录非 JSON，须脚本取 Token）：
#   node scripts/lib/jnpf-auth.mjs --json
#   node scripts/sync-http-env.mjs
#
# 在 VS Code 安装 REST Client 扩展后，点击每个请求上方的 "Send Request"
# 环境变量来自同目录 http-client.env.json（gitignore，由 sync-http-env 生成）

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@pipelineId = {{pipelineId}}

### 0. 冒烟 — CurrentUser
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/oauth/CurrentUser
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
jnpf-origin: pc

### 1. 诊断 — 交付物列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/{{pipelineId}}/deliverables
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 诊断 — IR 事件（查 AnalysisCompleted / SaMaterializationCompleted）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/ir/{{pipelineId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 诊断 — Skill 运行状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/skills/{{pipelineId}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. S2 确认 — 触发 C# SaMaterializer 物化（compile 模式无需 sa-service）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/skills/analyst/{{pipelineId}}/confirm-requirement-spec
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "autoRunDesign": false
}

### 5. 创建 pipeline（新链路时用；会写入 scripts/.sup-e2e-state.json 需另跑 create 脚本）
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/studio/pipeline/execute/create
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "name": "HTTP-TEST-{{$timestamp}}",
#   "userRequirement": "员工请假：申请、审批、归档。角色：员工/主管/HR。"
# }
